            0.151,
            0.461,
            0.848,
            0.554
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Consider the extension of the Gumulgal number system beyond 6 in the same way of counting by 2s. Come up with ways of performing the different arithmetic operations "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "( + , - , \\times , \\div )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " for numbers occurring in this system, without using Hindu numerals. Use this to evaluate the following:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.201,
            0.558,
            0.847,
            0.597
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) (ukasar-ukasar-ukasar-ukasar-urapon) + (ukasar-ukasar-ukasarurapon)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.195,
            0.6,
            0.846,
            0.621
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) (ukasar-ukasar-ukasar-ukasar-urapon) – (ukasar-ukasar-ukasar)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.625,
            0.802,
            0.645
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) (ukasar-ukasar-ukasar-ukasar-urapon) × (ukasar-ukasar)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.19,
            0.649,
            0.845,
            0.687
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iv) (ukasar-ukasar-ukasar-ukasar-ukasar-ukasar-ukasar-ukasar) ÷ (ukasar-ukasar)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.694,
            0.836,
            0.713
          ],
          "content": [
            {
