          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Identify the features of the Hindu number system that make it efficient when compared to the Roman number system."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.859,
            0.846,
            0.899
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " The Hindu number system (0, 1, 2, … 9) is much more efficient than Roman numerals (I, V, X, L, …)"
            }
          ]
